  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.18 \"Dwelling unit'' means “dwelling unit” as defined in RSA 153:1, III, namely, “a single unit providing complete and independent living facilities for one or more persons including permanent provisions for living, sleeping, eating, cooking, and sanitation.”\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
